I'd had things help

305
00:08:10,690 --> 00:08:12,220
for a week and then stop.

306
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,780
But somewhere in the
second week

307
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:14,870
I noticed I'd come down

308
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,670
