block.

324
00:08:39,690 --> 00:08:40,640
And for the first time

325
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,800
in two years,

326
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:43,150
I said yes.

327
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:45,210
I wanted to understand
why,

328
00:08:45,210 --> 00:08:46,670
so I read the whole thing.

329
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,140
It comes down to four
steps.

330
00:08:49,260 --> 00:08:50,020
One.

331
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:52,060
The tissue around a new
knee can

332
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:55,100
