surgery is over.

333
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:55,890
Two.

334
00:08:55,930 --> 00:08:58,350
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

335
00:08:58,350 --> 00:08:59,390
so it takes up more

336
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,590
room than it should.

337
00:09:00,830 --> 00:09:01,230
Three.

338
00:09:01,270 --> 00:09:03,030
There's only so much room
in there.

339
00:09:03,070 --> 00:09:04,580
Bending compresses it.

340
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:06,440
Straightening pulls it
tight.

341
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,790
That's the squeeze.

342
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:08,560
Four.

343
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:10,970
Red and near-infrared
light have been

344
00:09:10,970 --> 00:09:13,270
studied for calming that
inflammation,

345
00:09:13,270 --> 00:09:14,520
so the swelling and the
pressure

346
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,790
can come down with it.

347
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:17,540
In a randomized trial,

348
00:09:17,540 --> 00:09:19,330
patients given light
therapy after

349
00:09:19,330 --> 00:09:21,470
a knee replacement had
less pain,

350
00:09:21,470 --> 00:09:22,630
less swelling

351
00:09:22,630 --> 00:09:24,020
and better early movement
than

352
00:09:24,020 --> 00:09:24,860
those who weren't.

353
00:09:25,110 --> 00:09:27,800
A 2025 review said the
same,

354
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,080
and was clear the evidence

355
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,070
is still limited.

356
00:09:30,250 --> 00:09:32,070
I probably sound like a
broken record

357
00:09:32,070 --> 00:09:33,400
