kitchen.

358
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:35,590
But after two years of
doing everything

359
00:09:35,590 --> 00:09:37,490
I was told and getting
nowhere,

360
00:09:37,490 --> 00:09:38,910
you have no idea what it's

361
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,590
like to sleep through the
night,

362
00:09:40,590 --> 00:09:42,110
say yes to the walk,

363
00:09:42,110 --> 00:09:43,540
and get my life back.

364
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,020
So take it from me.

365
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:46,760
Don't spend another year
waiting

366
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:47,710
